      "proof": "The affine constant is C_a=sum_{j=0}^{m-1}3^(m-1-j)2^S_j. Divide by 2^S and index by reverse suffix length k. The suffix hypothesis bounds the k-th term by 3^(k-1)/2^(qk); summing the geometric series and comparing with 1-3^m/2^S gives the threshold bound. For the mass formula, reverse the i.i.d. geometric valuations and apply the skip-free ballot identity to increments a_i-2. For ordering, an adjacent swap changes only one prefix term; putting the larger valuation first increases that term.",
